      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name} The original post does not say it is a bug, it is requesting that Protonmail should be allowed. You should take it as a feature request/suggestion rather than close it as an invalid bug. Proton is legitimately used day to day by actual people, the restriction is not warranted, most definitely overboard and an inconvenience to people who don't use Gmail. VRC is frankly the only time I've had to use something else due to a block.",
